    <description>Project 790 change request: decides whether a proposal needs manager approval. Read-only - it only returns ApprovalRequired and ApprovalReason. Rules (any one triggers approval): new-hire owner (0-6 months from User.Hire_Date__c), owner in public group Proposal_Approval_High_Offenders, proposal Gross Profit (Quote.Gross_Profit__c) or opportunity Gross Profit (Opportunity.Gross_Profit__c) at or over GPThreshold, or any line (Application Solutions products only) that is a Renewal-flagged item, an Upgrade or Conversion item (Product2.Approval_Trigger__c or name starts with Upgrade/Conversion), or has a line Discount over DiscountThreshold. Exempt owners (Opportunity.Exempt_From_Proposal_Approval__c) never require approval. Thresholds are the three constants at the top of the flow.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>GP_Over_Threshold</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(AND(NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_Quote.Gross_Profit__c})), {!Get_Quote.Gross_Profit__c} &gt;= {!GPThreshold}), AND(NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_Opportunity.Gross_Profit__c})), {!Get_Opportunity.Gross_Profit__c} &gt;= {!GPThreshold}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>IsNewHire</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(NOT(ISBLANK({!Get_Owner.Hire_Date__c})), {!Get_Owner.Hire_Date__c} &gt;= ADDMONTHS(TODAY(), -1 * {!NewHireMonths}))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>ReasonTrimmed</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(LEN({!ReasonBuilder}) &gt; 2, LEFT({!ReasonBuilder}, LEN({!ReasonBuilder}) - 2), {!ReasonBuilder})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Quote Evaluate Approval Rules {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Quote Evaluate Approval Rules</label>
